=2 Walkthrough
* WARNING: You must complete {q:The Curious Case of Melvien|The Curious Case of Melvien|The Curious Case of Melvien} in order to begin the quest, otherwise no cutscene will occur
* Talk to {n:Roskin} in {z:Eastern Adoulin} (H-8) for a cutscene.
** Select "Who exactly made all these requests" followed by "Let's barrel in headfirst, then.".
* Head to {n:Polished Pebble} in {z:Western Adoulin} at the Inventor's Coalition (J-10).
* Return to {n:Roskin} for a cutscene.
* Head to the **__Well-Kept Cache**__ in {z:Yorcia Weald}, just north of Frontier Bivouac #2 at (I-10) for a cutscene.
* Examine it again to spawn a Fomor Ranger Notorious Monster, **__Inquisitor Mortuus**__. Content Level 115 fight.
** Capable of using {p:Eagle Eye Shot} multiple times.
** Skill chains seem to trigger blue proc. Unsure of effect but seems to cause NM to simply auto-attack/stand still.
** Drops the Key Item: {k:Weathered Haverton hat}
* Examine the **__Well-Kept Cache**__ again for a cutscene and the Key Item: {k:Forgotten memory}.
* Zone into {z:Eastern Adoulin} for a cutscene.
* Return to talk with {n:Roskin} twice.
* Talk to {n:Palomel} in {z:Eastern Adoulin} near {p:Scouts' Coalition} for a cutscene.
* Return to {n:Roskin} for a cutscene and the reward of your choice.
** Any time you may wish to exchange rewards, trade a {i:Frontier Soda|Frontier Soda|5944} to {n:Roskin}.
*** {i:Frontier Soda|Frontier Soda|5944} may be purchased nearby from {n:Bernegeois} in {z:Eastern Adoulin} (G-8).

=3 Optional
* Speak to {n:Wegellion} at (F-9) in the {p:Scouts' Coalition} in {z:Eastern Adoulin} who will request that you give him the {k:Weathered Haverton hat} while identifying its owner as Cedricaste.
** Giving him the Key Item results in a reward of 10,000 {p:Experience Points} and 3 {i:Pinches of High-Purity Bayld|H-P Bayld|8798}.

